NAME
       9p - 9P protocol client

SYNOPSIS
       9p -a <host> [-p port] { ls [path] | get <remote> [local] |
          put <local> <remote> | cat <remote> }

DESCRIPTION
       Talks to a 9P file server for one-off transfers, without
       mounting it.

OPTIONS
       -a H   server host
       -p N   server port

COMMANDS
       ls [path]            list a directory
       get remote [local]   download a file
       put local remote     upload a file
       cat remote           write a file to standard output

SEE ALSO
       mount9(1), ftp(1)
